I just had to share this nethack story.  I was at the top level of
Sokoban, petless, and trying to deal with the zoo in the last room.  A
little dog came nipping at my heels.  Well, I thought, I doubt a little
dog would be of much use to me right now, it'll probably just get
itself killed in no time.  But then, maybe it won't, and I don't like
killing potential allies, especially when I have more food than I need.
 So I tossed it a food ration.  The VERY NEXT thing that happend was
that I got swallowed by an air elemental but expelled by an ogre king.
I dispatched the chameleon.  "The little dog eats a chameleon corpse.
The little dog turns into a balrog!"

I sit back, grinning.  I think this little dog is going to be a useful
pet after all.

Reminds me of all those fairy tales where the hero or heroine is nice
to some miserable little creature, which turns out to be a powerful
wizard.  This is why nethack is so neat!


